The B/W proposal for the callers of overlay 230 (docs/BW_PLAN.md):
ov10_0216EB98, after a battle: the overlay-230 load and unload omitted;
its first two checks return the complement of r1, the third 0.
Each four-byte Thumb BL becomes two two-byte instructions, so every
later guest address stays put. SHA256SUMS pins the result.

